      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Wow, you're amazing! You're actually going to\r\ncheck out the situation in the Drawan Church's\r\nUnderground Crypt for us?",
        "Jp" : "まぁ～あんた、さすが！\r\nドラワン教会の《地下納骨堂》の様子、\r\n見て来てくれるんだね"
