      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, here's the thing... Apparently, it was a burial\r\nsite for high-ranking knights and mages back in\r\nthe day.",
        "Jp" : "で、何が気になるかなんだけどさ――\r\nあそこ実は高位の騎士や術師の\r\nお墓だったんだって"
