      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Don't worry, this was decades ago. If the ogre\r\nwas still there, it'd be dead from old age by now.\r\nIf something does show up, be sure to take care of\r\nit while you're there.",
        "Jp" : "大丈夫さ、何十年と前のことなんだ\r\n鬼がいても寿命で死んでるよきっと\r\nもしなんか出たら、ついでにやっつけちまってよ"
